con b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Gaston's Choreography</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Legends and tales have been told through songs for generations, but the worthy Hero can <i>create</i> songs in order to tell legends worthy of them.<br /> A Hero can activate Gaston's Choreography by spending 1 willpower in presence of a Beast suffering from an Anathema. As long as he sings and dances about the Beast's monstrous nature and/or his own heroic ways, he benefits from his Presence as bonus dice to any actions performed. Directly attacking the Beast breaks the effect of Gaston's Choreography. For example, leading the monster in a trap would benefit from it, but as soon as the hero tries to land the killing blow the effect would dissipate.</span></div> </div> </div> </div> \u266c&quot;I'm especially good at maaaking excuuuseees!&quot;\u266c<br /> <br /> Awesome Gift. I agree with Paradim, making the Beast sing along would be hilarious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T09:00:52-07:00","id":861084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/860378-the-hero-my-players-deserve?p=860639#post860639\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Add insult to injury. While under the effects of the Anathema, the Beast is forced to respond on key and performance. No matter how much they protest, they're part of the musical now.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Wow, and now the image of Smaug dancing around his lair \u266c&quot;My teeth are swords and claws are spears!&quot;\u266c<br /> <br /> You know, I had been picturing this whole thing happening in a lair, but it didn't strike me until right now how amazing this would be for a Beast hiding in say, a pack of vampires. &quot;Why is that man singing at you?... AND WHY ARE YOU SINGING BACK!&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T13:38:06-07:00","id":861259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VermillionDe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/860378-the-hero-my-players-deserve?p=861084#post861084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Wow, and now the image of Smaug dancing around his lair \u266c&amp;quot;My teeth are swords and claws are spears!&amp;quot;\u266c<br /> <br /> Yo